Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 02:01:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3624/3799] soh: rename func_80B5458C ->
 EnZl3_OverrideLimbDrawHair

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: sOverrideLimbDrawFuncs[0]: at limb 14 builds the seven-matrix hair chain into segment 0x0C, running the three springs at each joint. Named Hair because EnZl3_OverrideLimbDraw is the dispatcher that calls it
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
index b3c32d637..f4ea8e52d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
@@ -631,7 +631,8 @@ void EnZl3_StepHairPitch(EnZl3* this, s16 arg1, s32 arg2) {
     this->unk_2BC[arg2] = arg1;
 }
 
-s32 func_80B5458C(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3f* pos, Vec3s* rot, void* thisx, Gfx** gfx) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B5458C: sOverrideLimbDrawFuncs[0]: at limb 14 builds the seven-matrix hair chain into segment 0x0C, running the three springs at each joint. Named Hair because EnZl3_OverrideLimbDraw is the dispatcher that calls it
+s32 EnZl3_OverrideLimbDrawHair(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3f* pos, Vec3s* rot, void* thisx, Gfx** gfx) {
     s32 pad[3];
     EnZl3* this = (EnZl3*)thisx;
     s16* unk_28C = this->unk_28C;
@@ -2716,7 +2717,7 @@ void EnZl3_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 static OverrideLimbDraw sOverrideLimbDrawFuncs[] = {
-    func_80B5458C,
+    EnZl3_OverrideLimbDrawHair,  // was func_80B5458C [LLM:HIGH]
     func_80B5944C,
 };
 
